# The GATHER boot animation, untouched, then the home screen.
# Run: --boot full --fps 60 --frames 226
#
# No input at all: any key would skip the animation.
# 0-30:    a point grows into a ball of points
# 30-60:   the ball of points turns
# 60-90:   the ball pulls apart into a ribbon that ties itself in a loop
# 90-125:  the ribbon burns away from one end and the name POCKETME is
#          written out in its place
# 125-150: the solid name, a gold gleam over it, then it shrinks into the
#          home screen's title at the top left
# 150-163: the home screen fades in
# 163-225: the home screen stands still (BENCH tile chosen)
#
# Stills: frame 72 (the ribbon loop), frame 100 (the name being written
# while the ribbon burns).
